{"request_id": "a025ff31-deda-4551-8055-1daf4774cf75", "created_at": "2026-05-18T15:14:30+08:00", "query": "沒有收到帳單，如何繳費？", "top_k": 3, "answer": "精簡答案：若未收到健保費帳單，可透過「健保行動快易通APP」、至投保地公所或健保署分區業務組詢問，或使用自然人憑證於便利超商多媒體機台查詢並列印繳費單後繳費。\n\n補充重點：\n1. 健保署每月寄送之繳款單上均有條碼與聯絡電話，繳費需使用正式繳款單向銀行或郵局存入健保專戶。\n2. 若對繳費通知有疑問，可撥打健保免費服務專線（0800-030-598）或聯絡健保署各分區業務組確認。\n3. 繳費方式多元，包括臨櫃、約定轉帳、自動櫃員機、網路ATM及便利超商繳費。", "route_mode": "vector", "route_reason": "explanatory query pattern", "route_confidence": 0.75, "retrieved_chunks": [{"rank": 1, "doc_id": "insurance_008", "source": "insurance", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3794-a3f84-3246-1.html", "question": "曾有民眾收到以「全民健康保健中心」名義，寄發「健保滯納金催繳通知單」", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.4417523145675659}, {"rank": 2, "doc_id": "taxe_001", "source": "taxe", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3716-5c684-3245-1.html", "question": "要報稅了！如何查詢健保費繳費金額？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_total": 2, "distance": 0.48482680320739746}, {"rank": 3, "doc_id": "insurance_005", "source": "insurance", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3787-5fa86-3246-1.html", "question": "保險費應如何繳交？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_total": 3, "distance": 0.5496203899383545}], "table_matches": [{"rank": 1, "table_id": "student_foreign_premium", "title": "在學僑生、外籍生應繳納多少保險費，如何繳納", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3791-61e1b-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 5.0, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {}}], "references": [{"rank": 1, "title": "曾有民眾收到以「全民健康保健中心」名義，寄發「健保滯納金催繳通知單」", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3794-a3f84-3246-1.html", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 2, "title": "要報稅了！如何查詢健保費繳費金額？", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3716-5c684-3245-1.html", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 3, "title": "保險費應如何繳交？", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3787-5fa86-3246-1.html", "source": "vector"}], "latency_m