{"request_id": "44f7a95a-c981-432f-874b-f174bde84a61", "created_at": "2026-05-18T15:38:49+08:00", "query": "如何幫員工加保?", "top_k": 3, "answer": "精簡答案：企業雇主為受僱員工辦理加保時，應於員工受僱日起，向所屬投保單位申報加保資格。\n\n補充重點：\n1. 具有中華民國國籍且在臺灣設有戶籍且為一定雇主之受僱者，自受僱之日起即須加保。\n2. 投保單位負責按月從員工薪資中扣繳保險費，並連同單位應負擔部分一併繳交健保署。\n3. 同時具有兩份以上工作的員工，應以主要工作（工作時間長短及收入多寡為認定標準）參加健保。", "route_mode": "vector", "route_reason": "explanatory query pattern", "route_confidence": 0.75, "retrieved_chunks": [{"rank": 1, "doc_id": "other_010", "source": "other", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3638-fc192-3249-1.html", "question": "保險對象的投保資格為那些？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 2, "distance": 0.4300193786621094}, {"rank": 2, "doc_id": "other_022", "source": "other", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3616-fcf7d-3249-1.html", "question": "同時具有兩種以上工作者，應以何種身分參加健保？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.4312009811401367}, {"rank": 3, "doc_id": "insurance_005", "source": "insurance", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3787-5fa86-3246-1.html", "question": "保險費應如何繳交？", "chunk_type": "long_split", "length_type": "long", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 3, "distance": 0.4356018304824829}], "table_matches": [{"rank": 1, "table_id": "student_foreign_premium", "title": "在學僑生、外籍生應繳納多少保險費，如何繳納", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3791-61e1b-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 2.5, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {}}], "references": [{"rank": 1, "title": "保險對象的投保資格為那些？", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3638-fc192-3249-1.html", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 2, "title": "同時具有兩種以上工作者，應以何種身分參加健保？", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3616-fcf7d-3249-1.html", "source": "vector"}, {"rank": 3, "title": "保險費應如何繳交？", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3787-5fa86-3246-1.html", "source": "vector"}], "latency_ms": 4712, "status": "success", "error": null, "human_rating": null, "human_note": null}
{"request_id": "83fa3f23-fc8f-43e4-8bfc-b00af4d169bf", "created_at": "2026-05-18T15:40:21+08:00", "query": "健保署營業時間?", "top_k": 3, "answer": "精簡答案：\n健保署的服務電話上班時間為週一至週五8:30至17:30，假日則為9:00至17:00。\n\n補充重點：\n1. 健保署免付費服務專線是0800-030598，市話撥打。\n2. 上班時間專人接聽，假日則提供語音留言服務，並於上班時間回電。\n3. 「健康存摺」相關諮詢服務時間為週一至週五9:00~12:00及14:00~17:00。", "route_mode": "vector", "route_reason": "default to vector retrieval", "route_confidence": 0.55, "retrieved_chunks": [{"rank": 1, "doc_id": "insurance_001", "source": "insurance", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3729-f2020-3246-1.html", "question": "健保署有無提供服務電話供民眾查詢健保費等相關問題？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.40442168712615967}, {"rank": 2, "doc_id": "healthbank_016", "source": "healthbank", "url": "https://myhealthbank.nhi.gov.tw/IHKE3000/IHKE3115S03", "question": "我對「健康存摺」還是有很多疑問？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "medium", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.42866313457489014}, {"rank": 3, "doc_id": "other_035", "source": "other", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3548-1dd0b-3249-1.html", "question": "民眾對全民健保若有疑慮，可以透過那些管道獲得解答？", "chunk_type": "single", "length_type": "single", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 1, "distance": 0.4449513554573059}], "table_matches": [{"rank": 1, "table_id": "premium_subsidy", "title": "各級政府辦理保險對象健保費補助項目一覽表", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3789-62c16-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 3.5, "matched_rows": [], "matched_fields": [], "general_rules": {"auto_apply": ["左列多數補助資格，保險對象不需向健保署提出申請。", "由各補助單位按月提供符合補助名單，於健保費開計作業中直接扣減補助。", "如應受補助而未獲補助，可能因身分資料變更或補助名單延遲送達，可向補助單位、各縣市政府社政單位、健保署或投保單位洽詢。"], "manual_apply": ["設籍前新住民補助需每年提出申請。", "申請人須填具申請表並檢附相關證明文件，向健保署各分區業務組或聯絡辦公室提出申請。", "經核定符合資格者，自申請當月起補助自付保險費。"]}}, {"rank": 2, "table_id": "premium_ratio", "title": "各類保險對象保險費的負擔比率", "url": "https://www.nhi.gov.tw/ch/cp-3783-12823-3246-1.html", "source": "nhi", "score": 2.2, "matched_rows": [{"category": "第一類", "type_name": "雇主、自營業主、專門